subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Detect duplicate subscriptions by name similarity

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [dedupe] <OPTIONS>       Detect duplicate subscriptions by name similarity
  merge <OPTIONS>          Merge a duplicate subscription into another

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack dedupe --help
  subtrack dedupe merge --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                       Display this help message
  -v, --version                    Display this version
  --threshold <threshold>          Similarity threshold 0-1 (default: 0.8)
  -j, --json                       Output as JSON

